Pets don't actively search for better equipment, they only have their
generic (fairly low) chance of picking up any non-cursed item they
walk over. Maneuvring a pet into a dead end where you've placed its
intended equipment upgrade greatly speeds up the picking-up process -
from about a hundred turns to less than ten.

